repository-code: "https://github.com/itsuresha/agentic-automl-harness"
abstract: >-
  A conformal trial-gating watcher for LLM-driven AutoML agents that decides
  before each trial whether to run or skip it, with a distribution-free
  false-skip-rate guarantee derived from validation scores, canonical
  configuration hashes and execution metadata.
keywords:
  - AutoML
  - LLM agents
  - runtime monitoring
  - conformal risk control
  - data leakage
